      ["Do you like coffee? (tycker om, to one person)",["Tycker om du kaffe?","Om du tycker kaffe?","Tycker du kaffe?","Tycker du om kaffe?"],3,"In a yes/no question the verb comes first, and du sits between tycker and om."]
